{
 "encounter_id": "00914",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning, Mr Jarrah. The booking says sleep study results. Before I give you them, how have you been feeling? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tired, doctor. I'm always tired, I fall asleep in front of the telly by seven, and my wife says I snore like a chainsaw. Is it bad news?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's go step by step. How long has the snoring been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Years, I think. Maybe ten years? Mick says it's been worse lately."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the daytime sleepiness? When did it start?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm not sure. A year? Two? I can't really put a date on it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you wake up at night gasping?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, a few times a week. I sit bolt upright, my heart pounding."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Headaches in the morning?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Most mornings. Gone by ten."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain at night?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you ever fallen asleep while driving?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, never. Thank God. I'd stop the cab."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling in the ankles?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No swelling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. Metformin, 500 mg, twice a day. And omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. A rash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes, and high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "They straightened my nose, a deviated septum, in 2010."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anyone in the family with sleep trouble?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had sleep apnoea."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Taxi driver, thirty years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two beers every night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 148 over 92, pulse 80, temperature 36.6, oxygen 95 percent, breathing 16, and weight 118 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that high? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little. Open your mouth wide for me.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ahh. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your neck is thick, and the space at the back of the throat is narrow and crowded."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that why I snore? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's part of it. And there's no swelling in your legs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any heartburn at night?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, the tablet works."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now the study. You had the overnight sleep study last month, and it showed that you stopped breathing 28 times an hour."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Twenty-eight? Is that a lot? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's in the moderate range. It looks like moderate obstructive sleep apnoea, but I can't rule out an underactive thyroid adding to the tiredness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will I lose my licence? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not if we treat it. I'd like to arrange a trial of a CPAP machine, a mask that keeps your airway open, and I'd like to do a thyroid blood test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A mask? Every night? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It sounds worse than it is. Most people feel the difference within a week. Cut the beers, too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both are fair. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
